Wasatch Outfitters Collective (WOC): Supply Chain Digitization

Problem Statement: WOC experiences supplier delivery delays that contribute to stockouts and make inventory less reliable. Our project will investigate which vendors create the greatest delivery risk and how improved purchase-order tracking and earlier alerts could help purchasing staff and store managers respond before inventory runs out.

